  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/751/image_2024-03-04_102414885.png\" width=\"950\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsketchfab.com%252ffurti_two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1807/822/image_2026-07-20_221457219-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>《末影的愉悦》是一款<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>的扩展模组，让你能够利用在末地发现的惊人资源（如末影珍珠或紫颂果）烹饪美味佳肴。或者，将末影人或潜影贝的肉加入食谱，创造出真正非凡的美食。通过这款模组，你可以突破 Minecraft 中烹饪的界限，探索全新的美食维度。准备好去探索末地独特的风味，尝试新食谱，并用你的厨艺惊艳朋友们吧！</strong></p>\n<p>通过末地生物的新掉落物，为你的最爱菜肴发现新食材！用“末影视界”（不稳定的末影人眼球，能发出致盲光芒）为菜肴增添光彩。或者，用“潜影贝软体”（潜影贝坚硬外壳内的黏滑生物）为菜肴添加独特的质感。如果你想吃点酥脆的，试试“螨类脆皮”（酥脆但气味刺鼻的末影螨皮肤）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/753/image_2024-03-04_102524576.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/436/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/623/437/2023-02-15_22.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre>你可以将《末影的愉悦》加入你的整合包中！<br><br></pre>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以看看我的其他模组：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"